  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-cooling\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Dual Fuel Hybrid System Installation and Repair in Columbia, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>A dual fuel hybrid system pairs an electric heat pump with a gas furnace and lets the controls choose between them. In mild weather the heat pump carries the load, because moving heat costs less than burning fuel to make it. When outdoor temperatures fall to the point where the heat pump loses efficiency, the system hands off to the furnace. 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning installs, repairs, and maintains dual fuel systems in Columbia, SC and across the Midlands, with video-documented diagnostics and upfront pricing.</p>\n<p>Columbia&#8217;s winter profile is what makes the pairing worthwhile. Most heating hours here are mild, sitting squarely in the range where a heat pump is at its cheapest. But hard freezes arrive most winters, and those are the hours when gas heat recovers a cold house faster and often at lower cost. A dual fuel system uses each fuel where it wins instead of forcing one technology to cover both conditions.</p>\n<p>Homes without gas service get the all-electric version of this logic through our <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc/heat-pumps\">heat pump services</a>, and homes that prefer gas-first heating can review our <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc/furnaces\">furnace services</a>. Changeover behavior is managed through a compatible <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc/smart-thermostats\">smart thermostat</a>, which must support dual fuel staging. Schedule with 2nd Wind by phone, online, or 24/7 chat, and find out what a correctly configured dual fuel system can change about your bills.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18033921513\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18033921513\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(803) 392-1513</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has--color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technician performing diagnostic work on a unit in Columbia, SC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-on-a-unit-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Dual Fuel Repair</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">A dual fuel problem can sit in three places: the heat pump, the furnace, or the controls deciding between them. A system that runs the wrong fuel for the weather, cycles between modes, or leaves the house cold at handoff needs its changeover logic tested along with the equipment itself. Our technicians diagnose all three layers, record video of the finding, and quote the repair before work begins. Same-day emergency service is available for residential properties.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Dual Fuel Installation</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">The value of a dual fuel system lives in its changeover settings, so installation is a configuration job as much as an equipment job. We size both the heat pump and the furnace with a load calculation, then set the balance point, which is the outdoor temperature where the system switches fuels, based on the equipment&#8217;s performance and current utility rates. Set correctly, the furnace runs only during the hours it earns. Set wrong, the system burns gas on mild days or forces the heat pump through weather it cannot handle efficiently. You see the equipment options and prices at quote time.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Dual Fuel Maintenance</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">A dual fuel system needs the maintenance of both machines: refrigerant, coils, and defrost on the heat pump, plus burners, ignition, and a heat exchanger inspection on the furnace, with the changeover settings verified against current conditions. The Cloud 10 Membership through our <a href=\"/maintenance\">maintenance plans</a> keeps both halves on schedule, with member priority attached.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technician performing diagnostic work in Columbia, SC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Guaranteed Heating Excellence in Columbia, SC</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At 2nd Wind HVAC, we guarantee heating excellence with our team of highly skilled technicians, top-tier services, and reliable, energy-efficient solutions. We prioritize your comfort and satisfaction, offering comprehensive heating repairs, installations, and maintenance for homes in Columbia, SC. Trust us for all your heating needs, ensuring a warm and comfortable environment no matter the season.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-bloc